{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/453cbf320ffe5de99d58614e5ad7a436.avif?t=1753828314\" width=616 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bankshot is a fast paced Arena Platformer.\u00a0 Sprint, fly and bounce your way around dynamic battlefield's that will test your reflexes.\u00a0\u00a0 Don\u2019t let the instant vaporization shot distract you from the win.\u00a0 The game is balanced to reward trick shots to knock your opponent off into the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/62f1e815b09134c5477310aeab088329.poster.avif?t=1753828314\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/62f1e815b09134c5477310aeab088329.webm?t=1753828314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/62f1e815b09134c5477310aeab088329.mp4?t=1753828314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/2481813484c5a0422c8c463f99bb9b55.avif?t=1753828314\" width=616 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gobble up as many as you can, they all work together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/2e1aa59c904ee1f3730694b2a6de2e32.poster.avif?t=1753828314\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651